i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kvLsx66xYKwQ7kNvwFSCa29&_nc_oc=AdoArJjzDPsJvyAEtY3rtIezergWIka2Cxe2Gd3WOh94iF9dGTcjPIJPKchLIyrIdvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNcYGQliwTKtVhJZTKf3dZGna0vrF9ASv_IU0knjIYGBg&oe=6AE1F423"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yy6ZdOdvRpMQ7kNvwFdUdyM&_nc_oc=Adqk28jpmG36TOLawhjOXcbXlu96Gav4PaSKKRbEoGYGHrfOa2vjrXVG4zncD_PiyEw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCQMTpjIEBTI2zjZqcFHVIOWNrxQGCT3QMmnXjXlcdEQ&oe=6AE2185D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yWgHMu9qIo0Q7kNvwFnU3mU&_nc_oc=Adr_oBsW9TjLQRk7JhH6Jk6wN4-PoFhrXdKqFv4xlo8skYKvgo4dbAlcHxkHfCZhL08&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOoWcxpx1DJH0z5wYbN-IA0DJ2nL8-ELD7fszv6IWFeVw&oe=6AE206CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im